+### [Rendering-aware QP Offset Modelling](21036-rendering-aware-qp-offset-modelling.md)
+A compression-aware optimization method that approximates optimal Quantization Parameter (QP) distributions for RAHT coding of 3D Gaussians. It distinguishes itself by using a generalized heuristic based on spatial density and resolution to eliminate pre-analysis overhead, rather than iterative per-sequence fitting. Choose this when optimizing for compressed storage and streaming efficiency.
